  "description": "FUZBIP crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H103 Co3 N3 O25 Yb3 2+,3(C2 H3 N1),2(N1 O3 1-),1.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.235-3.828 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.50-110.64°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C48H103Co3N3O25Yb3·3(C2H3N)·2(NO3)·1.5H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
